	)
	(text "Camera: Arduino USB Camera (TPX00246) on the hub's USB-A port, ring light OFF.\n  Draws 250 mA (410 mA with ring light): use a powered hub / power bank on PD IN.\nOptical path (no wire): aim the camera at D1 from 10-30 cm, tube removed,\n  or at a white card that D1 lights.\nUses only the test light source block (D3, R2, Q1, R3, D1).\n  Not needed for the camera test: M1, R1/C1, Q2/R4."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 172.72 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9c19ed5c-993d-5541-b9df-381207ac3ff7")
	)
